  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">Cabinetry:</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Check all cabinet doors for correct alignment and operability. Check hardware and door handle. Tighten and adjust as necessary.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">Windows:</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Check all windows for operability and catalogue all problems noting deficiencies. Be prepared to give Milgard the entire number on the interior window frame.</li>
